   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on facilitating Ukraine&#xb4;s adjustment process to the EU&#xb4;s export control principles and procedures. The main partner is the State Service of Export Control of Ukraine (SSECU). The 2017 project activities were in line with a cooperation agreement, the Protocol of Intent between SSECU and SSM of March 2017. SSM supported an update of the SSECU website with specialized modules for exporters including online instructions on preliminary identification of goods, and search tools for the Single List of dual-use goods and control lists regulated by multilateral export control regimes.  The work continues in 2018.</narrative>
   </description>
